# 21. Avoid manual labor with conformance tests

You said you do not want manual labor or redundancy.

The answer is:

> Build a conformance suite.

Every provider/model must pass automated tests.

---

## Minimum test suite

### Test 1: Plain chat

Input:

```text
Say hello.
```

Expected:

```text
text response
```

---

### Test 2: Echo tool

Tool:

```json
{
  "name": "mirage_echo",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "text": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": ["text"]
  }
}
```

User:

```text
Call mirage_echo with text "ping".
```

Expected:

```text
[MIRAGE_TOOL_CALL_V1]
{
  "name": "mirage_echo",
  "arguments": {
    "text": "ping"
  }
}
