# 23. Do not remove XML immediately

Even though I prefer MTP/1, your test says XML injection currently works.

So do not just delete XML.

Do this:

```text
XML = legacy dialect
MTP = new primary dialect
```

Create a tool dialect abstraction:

```ts
type ToolDialect = "xml" | "mtp" | "native" | "none";
```

Then per model:

```ts
toolDialect: "mtp"
```

or:

```ts
toolDialect: "xml"
```

Run conformance tests.

If MTP beats XML for a model, switch it.

If XML is still better for a specific model, keep XML for that model.

That is robust and non-redundant.

