# 29. The final architecture in one picture

```text
Client
  ↓
OpenAI-compatible Mirage API
  ↓
Normalize OpenAI request
  ↓
Resolve provider/model profile
  ↓
If tools exist:
    compile tools into MTP prompt
    strip upstream tools if nativeTools=false
  ↓
Normalize message history:
    role=tool -> MTP_TOOL_RESULT
    assistant.tool_calls -> MTP_TOOL_CALL text
  ↓
Provider adapter
  ↓
Internal browser API
  ↓
Stream parser
  ↓
If MTP block:
    parse
    validate
    repair if needed
    convert to OpenAI tool_calls
Else:
    stream text
  ↓
Client receives OpenAI-compatible response
```

